Package: snplet
Type: Package
Title: Package for handling SNP based allele-specific expression analysis
Version: 0.6.4
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Shian", "Su",
      email = "su.s@wehi.edu.au",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0800-3567")
    )
  )
Description: Enables downstream analysis of allele-specific expression in single-cell RNA
    sequencing data using output from cellSNP-lite, Vireo, and cellranger VDJ. The package
    integrates SNP genotype calls, donor assignments, and clonotype annotations to assess
    allelic imbalance across individual cells. Clonotype annotations are used to aggregate
    cells for X-chromosome inactivation assignment. Core functionality includes statistical
    testing for allele usage against a null minor allele frequency and aggregation of allele
    counts across cells sharing clonotypes or donor identities.
